## Task 3: run security, dependency, and quality gates

- [ ] Verify remote cache only without printing credentials:

```bash
rg -n -- '--remote_executor|remote_execution|executor' .bazelrc .github/workflows || true
rg -n -- 'remote-cache|remote_cache|x-nativelink-api-key' .bazelrc .github/workflows/ci.yml
```

- [ ] Run Rust checks:

```bash
