## Task 4: mandatory full repository gate

- [ ] After the last source edit, run exactly:

```bash
bazel test //... --nocache_test_results --test_output=errors
```

- [ ] Do not call the task complete unless it exits 0.
- [ ] If a target fails, rerun that target streamed, fix the first causal error, rerun the focused target, then restart `bazel test //...` from the beginning.
- [ ] Make no code changes after the final successful full run; documentation may only be updated if it cannot alter tested behavior.

